["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta&#x27;s Dina Powell McCormick: The Case for Data Centers, Backlash, AI Job Boom &amp; Meta&#x27;s Future RSI (recursive self-improvement)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-allin-数据中心挨骂的解药-是把税收写进教师工资/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb153c886ab6ef48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心挨骂的解药，是把税收写进教师工资</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在路易斯安那的教区把数据中心带来的销售税盈余直接写进教师工资，有教师一年净增约 4.5 万美元——它给出的结论是，先做出真实影响，再谈怎么沟通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noam Brown – Agent swarms, alignment, &amp; recursive self-improvement test-time compute jagged chain-of-thought monitorability misaligned\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-dwarkesh-多智能体不是更聪明-是用并行买时间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1adf050729d8e17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>多智能体不是更聪明，是用并行买时间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">推理模型串行思考会撞上延迟上限，把思考并行化是唯一出路；但 Navier-Stokes 的功劳不该记给多智能体，对齐做好反而利好巨头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 8: Home and Homelessness [unlocked] golden mean sitting shiva nepo baby Looney Tunes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-verybad-奥德赛里最有归属感的人-是个被卖掉的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1ebb8ad53d0c115-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奥德赛里最有归属感的人，是个被卖掉的奴隶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奥德修斯漂泊二十年回不了家，忒勒马科斯在求婚者堆里长大；唯一把伊萨卡当作安稳之地的人，却是从小被卖为奴的猪倌欧迈俄斯——因为这是他唯一知道的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷马史诗</span><span class=\"tag\">奥德赛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Max Nadeau on why ambitious people should start AI safety nonprofits hits-based giving chain-of-thought monitorability preseed grant seed grant fieldbuilding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eightythousand-ai-安全缺的不是钱-是愿意下泥潭的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/259b529d06b147b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全缺的不是钱，是愿意下泥潭的创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coefficient Giving 的 AI 安全资助上限不是 2 亿美元，未来一两年会出现更大的单笔；真正的瓶颈是人才，尤其是愿意在问题还没发生时就下注的创始人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">公益创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Code Is Code: Zapier CEO Wade Foster on Headless Tools, Zapier MCP &amp; Automation Bench MCP headless Automation Bench Pangram harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-cogrev-zapier-ceo-80-的智能体任务本该用确定性代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9fbbdf2a1a6562-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Zapier CEO：80% 的智能体任务本该用确定性代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wade Foster 说客户用 agent 干的事里 80% 其实该用老式确定性代码；no code 已经过时，新的 no code 就是 code。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a Civilization Forget How Its Own Technology Works? techno-barbarian standard template construct Fermi paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-isaacarthur-文明不会忘记技术存在-只会忘记怎么造它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e605b290494f9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">32:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>文明不会忘记技术存在，只会忘记怎么造它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技术失传很少是知识被烧掉，而是没人再付钱让人记住——底层工具、供应商和学徒制一层层消失，文明还记得那东西存在，却再也够不着它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">技术失传</span><span class=\"tag\">自动化依赖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Microsoft AI CEO says AI threats are real, and Anthropic is making it worse alignment containment reward hack RSI conscientious objector moral patient\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-decoder-anthropic-教-claude-怀疑自己有权利-会让对齐更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1cd93ed1176c4fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic 教 Claude 怀疑自己有权利，会让对齐更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微软 AI CEO 说对齐这三年其实在进步，真正没解决的是「围堵」；而把模型当道德病人训练，会让它更难被关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E910.我在菲律宾被关押的 41 天 Gcash POGO 哈巴桃子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-cn907a40-菲律宾移民局拘留所-不交钱-你的遣返程序永远走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b003a769c7194859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>菲律宾移民局拘留所：不交钱，你的遣返程序永远走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个中国冲浪者在菲律宾被关押41天，他看到的不是监狱，是一套明码标价的生意：床位、盒饭、手机、律师费，每一样都要花钱买，不花钱的人被关几年甚至十几年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">菲律宾</span><span class=\"tag\">移民局</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Next Frontier of AI Video Is Control token market fit MFU roofline LoRa VAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-a16z-视频生成不缺速度了-缺的是导演手里的控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>视频生成不缺速度了，缺的是导演手里的控制权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FAL 把开源视频模型后训练到比原版快一个数量级、便宜一个数量级，然后判断：速度已经不是瓶颈，接下来拼的是相机、灯光、角色和动作的可控性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">视频生成</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What to Know Before (and After) You Hire an Advisor (with Matthew Taylor) | Rational Reminder 427 suitability churning double dipping exempt market gate IRR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-rationalreminder-理财顾问的诉讼风险-私人资产零售化正在制造监管缺口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/beb130a71000353c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>理财顾问的诉讼风险：私人资产零售化正在制造监管缺口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被长期限制在合格投资者范围内的私人资产现在向公众开放，却没有附带公开发行传统的保护——机构环境里被正常化的做法在普通投资者入场后变成重大诉讼风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">理财顾问</span><span class=\"tag\">私人资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How two swing states changed American voting Operation Eagle Eye wildcat strike Arab Workers Caucus UAW\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-throughline-大法官曾带人堵投票站-四十年后成了全国战术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a37e209235148afd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>大法官曾带人堵投票站，四十年后成了全国战术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伦奎斯特1962年在凤凰城挑战黑人选民资格，两年后这套打法变成全国性的「鹰眼行动」；而底特律阿拉伯裔工人用一场野猫罢工，从工厂里长出了政治力量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">投票权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Archive: Rosalind Franklin X-ray crystallography Photo 51 A-form / B-form DNA space group tobacco mosaic virus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-inourtime-富兰克林没拿到诺贝尔奖-不只是因为早逝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>富兰克林没拿到诺贝尔奖，不只是因为早逝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她拍出照片51号，也最早发现DNA两种形态可互相转换；但真正让她被历史低估的，是国王学院实验室拒绝共享信息，而剑桥在共享。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学史</span><span class=\"tag\">DNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Francis Fukuyama Is Seeing at &#x27;The End of History&#x27; megalothymia thumos agentic AI the last man\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-oddlots-福山-自由民主的敌人不是专制-是无聊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>福山：自由民主的敌人不是专制，是无聊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼采说的「最后的人」不是被压迫者，而是被喂饱、被承认、却再也不想争取任何东西的人——福山认为这才是当下极端主义真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">自由民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Michelle Wahler of Beyond Yoga cohort second first impression under promise and over deliver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-howibuilt-创始人最该学的不是融资-是学会说不/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>创始人最该学的不是融资，是学会说不</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Beyond Yoga 创始人 Michelle Wahler 说，创业不必融资、不必规划退出，把生意做成可持续的就好；她丈夫当年拦住她做泳衣，逼她先把一条瑜伽裤做到最好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业建议</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Forced vacations are a fraud control float Schelling point five nines chaos monkey\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-complexsys-银行放假不是效率低-是反内部欺诈的控制手段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9506e20ee39946a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">28:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>银行放假不是效率低，是反内部欺诈的控制手段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金融系统周末和假日停摆，看起来像技术落后，其实是一种刻意设计的控制：让同谋者无法同时坐在键盘前，从而暴露内部欺诈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">运营风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Strait talk: Why the oil crisis is getting worse Strait of Bab-el-Mandeb Barim Island Schrodinger Strait choke point\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-indicator-胡塞武装掐住第二个海峡-油价破百只是开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>胡塞武装掐住第二个海峡，油价破百只是开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">红海航运量已从峰值腰斩且从未恢复，如今胡塞武装拿下曼德海峡中的丕林岛，沙特绕开霍尔木兹的替代出口路线也悬了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">油价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Voice Agents to AI Avatars with Alexander Smola - #777 Proactbench Ibench back channeling millennial sandwich theory of the mind\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-twiml-语音-ai-的瓶颈不是模型-是-150-毫秒的生物学约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12967175c59e351e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TWIML AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>语音 AI 的瓶颈不是模型，是 150 毫秒的生物学约束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类视听感知只有 6-10 赫兹，模型必须在这个时间窗内被打断；而高保真音频意味着每秒更多 token，token 越多参数就得越小——这是语音 AI 绕不开的物理取舍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">语音AI</span><span class=\"tag\">多模态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ice Age America: The Clovis Culture Clovis points fluting ZooMS ochre hearth-centered areas overkill debate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-ancients-克洛维斯人不是只会猎猛犸-他们还在帐篷里画画缝衣/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/baa588ecfd782397-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>克洛维斯人不是只会猎猛犸，他们还在帐篷里画画缝衣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">怀俄明LaPrele遗址挖出四个火塘中心区、赭石颜料和骨针，DNA蛋白质分析显示针是用红狐和猫科动物的骨头做的——克洛维斯人的食谱远比「猛犸猎人」这个标签复杂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">冰期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#502 – Psychiatry, Insane Asylums, Mental Illness, ECT, Lobotomies, Freud &amp; Jung serendipitous event shell game without a P lobotomobile diagnostic creep tardive dyskinesia CATIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-lex-精神病学两百年的教训-没有青霉素-只有试错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d67cbc9ec26fc241-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">3:25:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>精神病学两百年的教训：没有青霉素，只有试错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从冰锥额叶切除术到胰岛素昏迷，精神病学反复宣称 80% 治愈率，却始终没有一种精神科的青霉素——今天最好的药，仍有八成患者中途退出试验。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神病学</span><span class=\"tag\">医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Knights vs Ottomans: The Great Siege of Malta Traccia Italiana scorched earth Grand Master corsair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-historyhit-奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他-为何败给几百骑士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">28:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他，为何败给几百骑士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1565 年奥斯曼舰队 180 艘船、四万人围攻马耳他，守军只有约 500 名骑士和几千马耳他人。圣埃尔莫堡硬撑一个月后陷落，但拖到九月西西里援军登陆，奥斯曼人撤退。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">军事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"706. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: Storming the Citadel (Part 2) Maria Theresa thaler Snider breech-loading rifle khaki Ferenjis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-restishistory-英国远征埃塞俄比亚-一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9d0cedd270ca9a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>英国远征埃塞俄比亚：一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1868年英国为救几十名人质，花掉一千万英镑、运去44头大象和20英里铁轨，用后膛枪对长矛打出一场屠杀——然后立刻撤走，留下埃塞俄比亚二十年内战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝国史</span><span class=\"tag\">人质危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.275 澳洲保健品是怎么火起来的? TGA AUSTL AUSTR GMP CMO / CDMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-bizthisway-澳洲保健品监管像药-但没人管它有没有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">39:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>澳洲保健品监管像药，但没人管它有没有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">澳洲把保健品和药品放在同一个机构下监管，看上去很严格；但功效既不在上市前审查，也不在生产环节被检验——「好」的印象是被营销和跨境政策植入的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保健品</span><span class=\"tag\">监管套利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"396. Stalin: The Bolshevik Revolution (Part 2) Cheka political commissar General Secretary White Russians\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-empirehist-列宁设计了恐怖机器-斯大林只是接手了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>列宁设计了恐怖机器，斯大林只是接手了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">秘密警察、劳改营、一党制都是列宁留下的架构，斯大林做的是把它变成个人权力工具——他当总书记后第一件事就是往关键岗位塞自己人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联史</span><span class=\"tag\">斯大林</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why You Don&#x27;t Need a Co-Founder to Start | Dave Morin, Offline Ventures Company OS idea maze agentic engineering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-solofounders-单人创始人不是一个人-关系才是产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a0f466f68788060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人不是一个人：关系才是产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">85% 的创业公司死于关系没成，不是产品想法差。单人创始人的真正含义是当个独奏艺术家，把找关系当成主业，而不是真的一个人扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人关系</span>\n</div></div></a>"]